"name": "Live Oak Bancshares, Inc.",
"description": "Live Oak Bancshares, Inc. is a bank holding company, which operates as a national online platform for small business lending. It operates through the following segments: Banking and Fintech. The Banking segment provides financing services to small businesses nationwide in targeted industries and deposit-related services to small businesses, consumers, and other customers nationwide. The Fintech segment focuses on making strategic investments in emerging financial technology companies. The company was founded by James S. Mahan III on December 18, 2008 and is headquartered in Wilmington, NC.",
